<title>Syria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/syria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-syria-2026-11-01T02:24:07.151Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 02:24:07 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Jordan launched air strikes against Syrian targets in retaliation for a church shooting, while Syrian officials said there were no border clashes with Jordan and framed security as a shared responsibility. Syria is actively discussing joining the Mecca defence pact, with its foreign minister confirming talks and another minister noting possible accession. A Syrian hacker received a 42‑month prison sentence for attacks on Western media and government targets. Jordanian security forces seized thermal balloons carrying weapons smuggled into Jordan in the Karak Governorate. The UCDP recorded 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxOMXVfVkFlUGYya1F1S09GMzdSMnNkaE9nbmkySGFtSkNHcklPRHdQblA5aEN1WDQ5QnVWb2czb3FocHNRalIwWXEzYl9NTzRJYTFUWGQ1NGpIR09EdkllVGd5QmpmZ21pd2dWRVpEczhvT3ZQUGpPaE1vdUpzN29kdzVTVWh1Uld6?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxObmNNNmZnOTYyOWlEVUQyRVJya3doNDh1eVFVR0NMbWZEWllaS2p4bU9NeGFaZ1VHOURsRFhScTVRYjZnVXJuZmNPTzJyNU43YlRrTWQ0cU9ldXQ1VGVadDhQbG5mcTZnX3JlZEFtWm9kbFZxVUNyQUVwQUZXRGd0bGJMNGtuQ0c1cnhiNzJ0RWloNGRJajZEZjN3al8zZDFINHJHeldUTWJOVUc2Qk1PVUVKU0hLNFBqYU83cEVR?oc=5&quot;&gt;NPR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNamZrOUp2WjNZeWZrS1ROU09mTmg4cWNCSWNsWjJKWXkzazk2WnFxb1FxeDR3dkZYX3dmallZVzVDVDczZmxCaHB1bEw0VmZOemFraVAtTm9CQ0t6R2FpZHF2MHl6MWNHbVdrRWkzeTFmdlh5aWNRWUxyU0MtOHo5WTlRSG5rTTNGWXNyeUVSeXA4b2RQaTlHbUZHN3B3dHNpZVVFU0U2ZUVaaDBwd3pEMWtR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arab News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxPd1hqblY0TzdleGhXaXQ4ODdsc3ZQV3A1czJvX0VSQkV6SVRUNnlNYmlneEhGNWpKbkF5SUxULW9sM